[[:db/add "568999d4-4889-5a98-bcd1-0e4e8ca80b91" :answer/id #uuid "568999d4-4889-5a98-bcd1-0e4e8ca80b91"] [:db/add "568999d4-4889-5a98-bcd1-0e4e8ca80b91" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "568999d4-4889-5a98-bcd1-0e4e8ca80b91" :answer/value "\\frac{263}{16}"] [:db/ensure "568999d4-4889-5a98-bcd1-0e4e8ca80b91" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3d28ea72-04ae-5db8-b62d-9aec5492882b" :answer-field/id #uuid "3d28ea72-04ae-5db8-b62d-9aec5492882b"] [:db/add "3d28ea72-04ae-5db8-b62d-9aec5492882b" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "3d28ea72-04ae-5db8-b62d-9aec5492882b" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "3d28ea72-04ae-5db8-b62d-9aec5492882b" :answer-field/choices "568999d4-4889-5a98-bcd1-0e4e8ca80b91"] [:db/add "3d28ea72-04ae-5db8-b62d-9aec5492882b" :answer-field/correct "568999d4-4889-5a98-bcd1-0e4e8ca80b91"] [:db/ensure "3d28ea72-04ae-5db8-b62d-9aec5492882b" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "6793f98f-38e5-5e4e-87b0-0c228eeb1231" :answer/id #uuid "6793f98f-38e5-5e4e-87b0-0c228eeb1231"] [:db/add "6793f98f-38e5-5e4e-87b0-0c228eeb1231" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6793f98f-38e5-5e4e-87b0-0c228eeb1231" :answer/value "0"] [:db/ensure "6793f98f-38e5-5e4e-87b0-0c228eeb1231" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9e991031-582e-5686-a53b-62bf31e1399b" :answer-field/id #uuid "9e991031-582e-5686-a53b-62bf31e1399b"] [:db/add "9e991031-582e-5686-a53b-62bf31e1399b" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "9e991031-582e-5686-a53b-62bf31e1399b" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "9e991031-582e-5686-a53b-62bf31e1399b" :answer-field/choices "6793f98f-38e5-5e4e-87b0-0c228eeb1231"] [:db/add "9e991031-582e-5686-a53b-62bf31e1399b" :answer-field/correct "6793f98f-38e5-5e4e-87b0-0c228eeb1231"] [:db/ensure "9e991031-582e-5686-a53b-62bf31e1399b" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "b29dd078-2ebc-5d53-826e-4eebe7992cae" :question/id #uuid "b29dd078-2ebc-5d53-826e-4eebe7992cae"] [:db/add "b29dd078-2ebc-5d53-826e-4eebe7992cae" :question/problem "Find where the normal line to the curve $y=-2\\sqrt[4]{x}-3$ at the point $(16,-7)$ intersects the $x$-axis.\n\nThe intersection is $(${{field-1}}$,$ {{field-2}}$)$. Give exact values."] [:db/add "b29dd078-2ebc-5d53-826e-4eebe7992cae" :question/worked-solution "Rewrite the radical or reciprocal using powers, then differentiate.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf(x)&=- 2 x^{\\frac{1}{4}} - 3, \\\\f'(x)&=- \\frac{1}{2 x^{\\frac{3}{4}}}=- \\frac{1}{2 x^{\\frac{3}{4}}}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluate the tangent slope and take its negative reciprocal to find the normal slope.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nm_t=f'(16)&=- \\frac{1}{2 (16)^{\\frac{3}{4}}}=- \\frac{1}{16}, \\\\m_n=-\\frac{1}{m_t}&=-\\frac{1}{\\left(- \\frac{1}{16}\\right)}=16.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse point-slope form through $(16,-7)$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny-(-7)&=16(x-(16)), \\\\y&=16 x - 263.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAt the $x$-axis, $y=0$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n0&=16x+(-263), \\\\x&=\\frac{263}{16}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe intersection is $\\left(\\frac{263}{16},0\\right)$."] [:db/add "b29dd078-2ebc-5d53-826e-4eebe7992cae" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "b29dd078-2ebc-5d53-826e-4eebe7992cae" :question/answer-fields "3d28ea72-04ae-5db8-b62d-9aec5492882b"] [:db/add "b29dd078-2ebc-5d53-826e-4eebe7992cae" :question/answer-fields "9e991031-582e-5686-a53b-62bf31e1399b"] [:db/ensure "b29dd078-2ebc-5d53-826e-4eebe7992cae" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186092385 :knowledge-point/questions "b29dd078-2ebc-5d53-826e-4eebe7992cae"] [:db/add "edf92b3a-5431-50ab-beed-623ef07b5994" :answer/id #uuid "edf92b3a-5431-50ab-beed-623ef07b5994"] [:db/add "edf92b3a-5431-50ab-beed-623ef07b5994" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "edf92b3a-5431-50ab-beed-623ef07b5994" :answer/value "0"] [:db/ensure "edf92b3a-5431-50ab-beed-623ef07b5994" :answer/validate] [:db/add "71568e09-28aa-59ac-8ca3-5dbb95764716" :answer-field/id #uuid "71568e09-28aa-59ac-8ca3-5dbb95764716"] [:db/add "71568e09-28aa-59ac-8ca3-5dbb95764716" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "71568e09-28aa-59ac-8ca3-5dbb95764716" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "71568e09-28aa-59ac-8ca3-5dbb95764716" :answer-field/choices "edf92b3a-5431-50ab-beed-623ef07b5994"] [:db/add "71568e09-28aa-59ac-8ca3-5dbb95764716" :answer-field/correct "edf92b3a-5431-50ab-beed-623ef07b5994"] [:db/ensure "71568e09-28aa-59ac-8ca3-5dbb95764716" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "987575de-1233-554d-bad4-462cace7ab49" :answer/id #uuid "987575de-1233-554d-bad4-462cace7ab49"] [:db/add "987575de-1233-554d-bad4-462cace7ab49" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "987575de-1233-554d-bad4-462cace7ab49" :answer/value "- \\frac{17}{3}"] [:db/ensure "987575de-1233-554d-bad4-462cace7ab49" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9fffbf35-c438-5860-919c-71e3071c2bff" :answer-field/id #uuid "9fffbf35-c438-5860-919c-71e3071c2bff"] [:db/add "9fffbf35-c438-5860-919c-71e3071c2bff" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "9fffbf35-c438-5860-919c-71e3071c2bff" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "9fffbf35-c438-5860-919c-71e3071c2bff" :answer-field/choices "987575de-1233-554d-bad4-462cace7ab49"] [:db/add "9fffbf35-c438-5860-919c-71e3071c2bff" :answer-field/correct "987575de-1233-554d-bad4-462cace7ab49"] [:db/ensure "9fffbf35-c438-5860-919c-71e3071c2bff" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "faa54547-2c59-5b03-b679-878d5c36016f" :question/id #uuid "faa54547-2c59-5b03-b679-878d5c36016f"] [:db/add "faa54547-2c59-5b03-b679-878d5c36016f" :question/problem "Find where the normal line to the curve $y=-3\\sqrt{x}-2$ at the point $(1,-5)$ intersects the $y$-axis.\n\nThe intersection is $(${{field-1}}$,$ {{field-2}}$)$. Give exact values."] [:db/add "faa54547-2c59-5b03-b679-878d5c36016f" :question/worked-solution "Rewrite the radical or reciprocal using powers, then differentiate.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf(x)&=- 3 x^{\\frac{1}{2}} - 2, \\\\f'(x)&=- \\frac{3}{2 x^{\\frac{1}{2}}}=- \\frac{3}{2 \\sqrt{x}}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluate the tangent slope and take its negative reciprocal to find the normal slope.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nm_t=f'(1)&=- \\frac{3}{2 \\sqrt{(1)}}=- \\frac{3}{2}, \\\\m_n=-\\frac{1}{m_t}&=-\\frac{1}{\\left(- \\frac{3}{2}\\right)}=\\frac{2}{3}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse point-slope form through $(1,-5)$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny-(-5)&=\\frac{2}{3}(x-(1)), \\\\y&=\\frac{2 x}{3} - \\frac{17}{3}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAt the $y$-axis, $x=0$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny&=\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot 0+\\left(- \\frac{17}{3}\\right), \\\\y&=- \\frac{17}{3}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe intersection is $\\left(0,- \\frac{17}{3}\\right)$."] [:db/add "faa54547-2c59-5b03-b679-878d5c36016f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "faa54547-2c59-5b03-b679-878d5c36016f" :question/answer-fields "71568e09-28aa-59ac-8ca3-5dbb95764716"] [:db/add "faa54547-2c59-5b03-b679-878d5c36016f" :question/answer-fields "9fffbf35-c438-5860-919c-71e3071c2bff"] [:db/ensure "faa54547-2c59-5b03-b679-878d5c36016f" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186092385 :knowledge-point/questions "faa54547-2c59-5b03-b679-878d5c36016f"] [:db/add "9b36f04f-29a4-57f4-b792-3d8cddf7dbb7" :answer/id #uuid "9b36f04f-29a4-57f4-b792-3d8cddf7dbb7"] [:db/add "9b36f04f-29a4-57f4-b792-3d8cddf7dbb7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9b36f04f-29a4-57f4-b792-3d8cddf7dbb7" :answer/value "25"] [:db/ensure "9b36f04f-29a4-57f4-b792-3d8cddf7dbb7" :answer/validate] [:db/add "105f3b7c-32d3-5721-896a-80a7e4481dd8" :answer-field/id #uuid "105f3b7c-32d3-5721-896a-80a7e4481dd8"] [:db/add "105f3b7c-32d3-5721-896a-80a7e4481dd8" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "105f3b7c-32d3-5721-896a-80a7e4481dd8" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "105f3b7c-32d3-5721-896a-80a7e4481dd8" :answer-field/choices "9b36f04f-29a4-57f4-b792-3d8cddf7dbb7"] [:db/add "105f3b7c-32d3-5721-896a-80a7e4481dd8" :answer-field/correct "9b36f04f-29a4-57f4-b792-3d8cddf7dbb7"] [:db/ensure "105f3b7c-32d3-5721-896a-80a7e4481dd8" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "00e8d86d-1129-5622-a67f-6cdd2601671e" :answer/id #uuid "00e8d86d-1129-5622-a67f-6cdd2601671e"] [:db/add "00e8d86d-1129-5622-a67f-6cdd2601671e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "00e8d86d-1129-5622-a67f-6cdd2601671e" :answer/value "0"] [:db/ensure "00e8d86d-1129-5622-a67f-6cdd2601671e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e756993e-1199-53fc-a2ee-d01738092d6f" :answer-field/id #uuid "e756993e-1199-53fc-a2ee-d01738092d6f"] [:db/add "e756993e-1199-53fc-a2ee-d01738092d6f" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "e756993e-1199-53fc-a2ee-d01738092d6f" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "e756993e-1199-53fc-a2ee-d01738092d6f" :answer-field/choices "00e8d86d-1129-5622-a67f-6cdd2601671e"] [:db/add "e756993e-1199-53fc-a2ee-d01738092d6f" :answer-field/correct "00e8d86d-1129-5622-a67f-6cdd2601671e"] [:db/ensure "e756993e-1199-53fc-a2ee-d01738092d6f" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "2ed6c176-c8ce-5e49-a7ef-0346fa82cc02" :question/id #uuid "2ed6c176-c8ce-5e49-a7ef-0346fa82cc02"] [:db/add "2ed6c176-c8ce-5e49-a7ef-0346fa82cc02" :question/problem "Find where the normal line to the curve $y=\\sqrt{x^{3}}-1$ at the point $(4,7)$ intersects the $x$-axis.\n\nThe intersection is $(${{field-1}}$,$ {{field-2}}$)$. Give exact values."] [:db/add "2ed6c176-c8ce-5e49-a7ef-0346fa82cc02" :question/worked-solution "Rewrite the radical or reciprocal using powers, then differentiate.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf(x)&=x^{\\frac{3}{2}} - 1, \\\\f'(x)&=\\frac{3 x^{\\frac{1}{2}}}{2}=\\frac{3 \\sqrt{x}}{2}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluate the tangent slope and take its negative reciprocal to find the normal slope.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nm_t=f'(4)&=\\frac{3 \\sqrt{(4)}}{2}=3, \\\\m_n=-\\frac{1}{m_t}&=-\\frac{1}{(3)}=- \\frac{1}{3}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse point-slope form through $(4,7)$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny-(7)&=- \\frac{1}{3}(x-(4)), \\\\y&=- \\frac{x}{3} + \\frac{25}{3}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAt the $x$-axis, $y=0$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n0&=- \\frac{1}{3}x+\\left(\\frac{25}{3}\\right), \\\\x&=25.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe intersection is $(25,0)$."] [:db/add "2ed6c176-c8ce-5e49-a7ef-0346fa82cc02" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "2ed6c176-c8ce-5e49-a7ef-0346fa82cc02" :question/answer-fields "105f3b7c-32d3-5721-896a-80a7e4481dd8"] [:db/add "2ed6c176-c8ce-5e49-a7ef-0346fa82cc02" :question/answer-fields "e756993e-1199-53fc-a2ee-d01738092d6f"] [:db/ensure "2ed6c176-c8ce-5e49-a7ef-0346fa82cc02" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186092385 :knowledge-point/questions "2ed6c176-c8ce-5e49-a7ef-0346fa82cc02"] [:db/add "4d6ce5d3-903a-5e82-90e6-9d71c4be85f4" :answer/id #uuid "4d6ce5d3-903a-5e82-90e6-9d71c4be85f4"] [:db/add "4d6ce5d3-903a-5e82-90e6-9d71c4be85f4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4d6ce5d3-903a-5e82-90e6-9d71c4be85f4" :answer/value "0"] [:db/ensure "4d6ce5d3-903a-5e82-90e6-9d71c4be85f4" :answer/validate] [:db/add "7a507089-6cf8-5df8-b8df-3ac97398dd75" :answer-field/id #uuid "7a507089-6cf8-5df8-b8df-3ac97398dd75"] [:db/add "7a507089-6cf8-5df8-b8df-3ac97398dd75" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "7a507089-6cf8-5df8-b8df-3ac97398dd75" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "7a507089-6cf8-5df8-b8df-3ac97398dd75" :answer-field/choices "4d6ce5d3-903a-5e82-90e6-9d71c4be85f4"] [:db/add "7a507089-6cf8-5df8-b8df-3ac97398dd75" :answer-field/correct "4d6ce5d3-903a-5e82-90e6-9d71c4be85f4"] [:db/ensure "7a507089-6cf8-5df8-b8df-3ac97398dd75" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "d88521b3-53b8-5a17-a4c2-f70e3754ec37" :answer/id #uuid "d88521b3-53b8-5a17-a4c2-f70e3754ec37"] [:db/add "d88521b3-53b8-5a17-a4c2-f70e3754ec37" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d88521b3-53b8-5a17-a4c2-f70e3754ec37" :answer/value "17"] [:db/ensure "d88521b3-53b8-5a17-a4c2-f70e3754ec37" :answer/validate] [:db/add "963d8c9b-cc10-5c12-8b87-028a86b2e2b6" :answer-field/id #uuid "963d8c9b-cc10-5c12-8b87-028a86b2e2b6"] [:db/add "963d8c9b-cc10-5c12-8b87-028a86b2e2b6" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "963d8c9b-cc10-5c12-8b87-028a86b2e2b6" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "963d8c9b-cc10-5c12-8b87-028a86b2e2b6" :answer-field/choices "d88521b3-53b8-5a17-a4c2-f70e3754ec37"] [:db/add "963d8c9b-cc10-5c12-8b87-028a86b2e2b6" :answer-field/correct "d88521b3-53b8-5a17-a4c2-f70e3754ec37"] [:db/ensure "963d8c9b-cc10-5c12-8b87-028a86b2e2b6" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "29406d9f-bf1b-52ad-b004-ccc298593364" :question/id #uuid "29406d9f-bf1b-52ad-b004-ccc298593364"] [:db/add "29406d9f-bf1b-52ad-b004-ccc298593364" :question/problem "Find where the normal line to the curve $y=3\\sqrt[3]{x^{2}}-3$ at the point $(8,9)$ intersects the $y$-axis.\n\nThe intersection is $(${{field-1}}$,$ {{field-2}}$)$. Give exact values."] [:db/add "29406d9f-bf1b-52ad-b004-ccc298593364" :question/worked-solution "Rewrite the radical or reciprocal using powers, then differentiate.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf(x)&=3 x^{\\frac{2}{3}} - 3, \\\\f'(x)&=\\frac{2}{x^{\\frac{1}{3}}}=\\frac{2}{\\sqrt[3]{x}}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluate the tangent slope and take its negative reciprocal to find the normal slope.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nm_t=f'(8)&=\\frac{2}{\\sqrt[3]{(8)}}=1, \\\\m_n=-\\frac{1}{m_t}&=-\\frac{1}{(1)}=-1.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse point-slope form through $(8,9)$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny-(9)&=-1(x-(8)), \\\\y&=- x + 17.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAt the $y$-axis, $x=0$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny&=-1\\cdot 0+(17), \\\\y&=17.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe intersection is $(0,17)$."] [:db/add "29406d9f-bf1b-52ad-b004-ccc298593364" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "29406d9f-bf1b-52ad-b004-ccc298593364" :question/answer-fields "7a507089-6cf8-5df8-b8df-3ac97398dd75"] [:db/add "29406d9f-bf1b-52ad-b004-ccc298593364" :question/answer-fields "963d8c9b-cc10-5c12-8b87-028a86b2e2b6"] [:db/ensure "29406d9f-bf1b-52ad-b004-ccc298593364" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186092385 :knowledge-point/questions "29406d9f-bf1b-52ad-b004-ccc298593364"] [:db/add "f5e6aff2-b373-5430-b1d1-8590f82466c7" :answer/id #uuid "f5e6aff2-b373-5430-b1d1-8590f82466c7"] [:db/add "f5e6aff2-b373-5430-b1d1-8590f82466c7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f5e6aff2-b373-5430-b1d1-8590f82466c7" :answer/value "\\frac{11}{8}"] [:db/ensure "f5e6aff2-b373-5430-b1d1-8590f82466c7" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c0b9097b-e0d1-5242-9d99-bd382092dbc9" :answer-field/id #uuid "c0b9097b-e0d1-5242-9d99-bd382092dbc9"] [:db/add "c0b9097b-e0d1-5242-9d99-bd382092dbc9" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "c0b9097b-e0d1-5242-9d99-bd382092dbc9" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "c0b9097b-e0d1-5242-9d99-bd382092dbc9" :answer-field/choices "f5e6aff2-b373-5430-b1d1-8590f82466c7"] [:db/add "c0b9097b-e0d1-5242-9d99-bd382092dbc9" :answer-field/correct "f5e6aff2-b373-5430-b1d1-8590f82466c7"] [:db/ensure "c0b9097b-e0d1-5242-9d99-bd382092dbc9" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "1bc39092-d8e9-5453-8c18-574cb938a383" :answer/id #uuid "1bc39092-d8e9-5453-8c18-574cb938a383"] [:db/add "1bc39092-d8e9-5453-8c18-574cb938a383" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1bc39092-d8e9-5453-8c18-574cb938a383" :answer/value "0"] [:db/ensure "1bc39092-d8e9-5453-8c18-574cb938a383" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9f59a7a4-1543-5be4-a86a-343a53b151e1" :answer-field/id #uuid "9f59a7a4-1543-5be4-a86a-343a53b151e1"] [:db/add "9f59a7a4-1543-5be4-a86a-343a53b151e1" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "9f59a7a4-1543-5be4-a86a-343a53b151e1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "9f59a7a4-1543-5be4-a86a-343a53b151e1" :answer-field/choices "1bc39092-d8e9-5453-8c18-574cb938a383"] [:db/add "9f59a7a4-1543-5be4-a86a-343a53b151e1" :answer-field/correct "1bc39092-d8e9-5453-8c18-574cb938a383"] [:db/ensure "9f59a7a4-1543-5be4-a86a-343a53b151e1" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "0528d2f1-a7ca-57e0-815f-c74f80d05fe5" :question/id #uuid "0528d2f1-a7ca-57e0-815f-c74f80d05fe5"] [:db/add "0528d2f1-a7ca-57e0-815f-c74f80d05fe5" :question/problem "Find where the normal line to the curve $y=\\frac{1}{x}+2$ at the point $\\left(2,\\frac{5}{2}\\right)$ intersects the $x$-axis.\n\nThe intersection is $(${{field-1}}$,$ {{field-2}}$)$. Give exact values."] [:db/add "0528d2f1-a7ca-57e0-815f-c74f80d05fe5" :question/worked-solution "Rewrite the radical or reciprocal using powers, then differentiate.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf(x)&=2 + \\frac{1}{x}, \\\\f'(x)&=- \\frac{1}{x^{2}}=- \\frac{1}{x^{2}}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluate the tangent slope and take its negative reciprocal to find the normal slope.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nm_t=f'(2)&=- \\frac{1}{(2)^{2}}=- \\frac{1}{4}, \\\\m_n=-\\frac{1}{m_t}&=-\\frac{1}{\\left(- \\frac{1}{4}\\right)}=4.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse point-slope form through $\\left(2,\\frac{5}{2}\\right)$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny-\\left(\\frac{5}{2}\\right)&=4(x-(2)), \\\\y&=4 x - \\frac{11}{2}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAt the $x$-axis, $y=0$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n0&=4x+\\left(- \\frac{11}{2}\\right), \\\\x&=\\frac{11}{8}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe intersection is $\\left(\\frac{11}{8},0\\right)$."] [:db/add "0528d2f1-a7ca-57e0-815f-c74f80d05fe5" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "0528d2f1-a7ca-57e0-815f-c74f80d05fe5" :question/answer-fields "c0b9097b-e0d1-5242-9d99-bd382092dbc9"] [:db/add "0528d2f1-a7ca-57e0-815f-c74f80d05fe5" :question/answer-fields "9f59a7a4-1543-5be4-a86a-343a53b151e1"] [:db/ensure "0528d2f1-a7ca-57e0-815f-c74f80d05fe5" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186092385 :knowledge-point/questions "0528d2f1-a7ca-57e0-815f-c74f80d05fe5"] [:db/ensure 17592186092385 :knowledge-point/validate]]
